{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961120/extras/52bbe7a16a4d66b77d490e51a99ee906.avif?t=1771981653\" width=567 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Box is Alive</i> is a chaotic, silly-physics platformer about one brave package\u2019s quest for self-delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a sentient cardboard box who wakes up in a deserted shipping facility. No humans. No labels. No carriers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So it\u2019s time to take matters into your own flaps.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, jump, and glide your way through a maze of conveyor belts, crushers, and other OSHA-unapproved obstacles. Escape the warehouse and continue en route through suburbia, skyscrapers, sewers, and more to reach your recipient.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the most out of each environment, exploring every crack and corner to find the best route to your final destination. Every level has its secrets\u2014from bonus stages, to tricky puzzles, and other packages searching for purpose.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you box enough to escape? Or will you get trashed trying? Download our demo and get rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961120/extras/b51060cb21d46e043350e4eef16d8154.avif?t=1771981653\" width=567 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Out-of-the-Box Gameplay </strong>\u2013 Roll, jump, slam, flap, and glide through dangerous obstacles as you discover unexpected routes and unpredictable solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control with Care </strong>\u2013 Easy to pick up, but hard to master\u2013a small nudge can ship you to the next stage, while one misflip can launch you straight into the shredder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sign, Seal, Survive</strong> \u2013 Master both lighthearted platforming and tougher precision challenges, with leaderboards to prove your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbox New Levels </strong>\u2013 There's a big world out there! Launch across roof tops, slip through the sewers, and skydive from an airplane to continue en route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick &amp; Style</strong> \u2013 Collect stamps and special stickers as you explore the world\u2014unlocking cosmetic wraps for the Box in future updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Box Beats </strong>\u2013 Featuring \u201cEETS ALIVE\u201d and other original tracks composed especially for <i>The Box is Alive</i>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961120?t=1771981653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961120/a2473b9ecda3b0d97812c4780b8b3a39bef93ef3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771981653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961120/b504f27a5e7fd167eddefd43099929016162592a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771981653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961120/b504f27a5e7fd167eddefd43099929016162592a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771981653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],