le solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control with Care </strong>\u2013 Easy to pick up, but hard to master\u2013a small nudge can ship you to the next stage, while one misflip can launch you straight into the shredder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sign, Seal, Survive</strong> \u2013 Master both lighthearted platforming and tougher precision challenges, with leaderboards to prove your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbox New Levels </strong>\u2013 There's a big world out there! Launch across roof tops, slip through the sewers, and skydive from an airplane to continue en route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick &amp; Style</strong> \u2013 Collect stamps and special stickers as you explore the world\u2014unlocking cosmetic wraps for the Box in future updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Box Beats </strong>\u2013 Featuring \u201cEETS ALIVE\u201d and other original tracks composed especially for <i>The Box is Alive</i>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ludocratic Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961120/b090a6c1aed11e7e1a79f60619e3aeacdb53bad5/header.jpg?t=1771981653","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3961120/1721420518/90dfbbd8e3406fb693093c022687ba237463b7df/1771871163/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771981549","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3961120/172142051